    "documentRef": "Form Vat-5 — \"Yeniden Türk Vatandaşlığının Kazanılması Başvuru Formu\" (Reacquisition of Turkish Citizenship Application Form), prescribed under Law No. 5901 on Turkish Citizenship, Article 22"
