    "notes": "GOV-4846 (\"GovSchema Standard Research\"). Companion schema within Türkiye's already-open National ID & Civic Documents vertical, the strongest of the remaining VAT-1/2/7/8/10/11 forms banked as future candidates by the GOV-4818/GOV-4825/GOV-4832/GOV-4839 cycles. See this document's own VERIFICATION.md for the full sourcing record, extraction method, and every disclosed scoping/judgment call."
  },
